      "created_at": "2019-10-07T03:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure if you can repeat it, since it's \"as if played\" rather than \"played\". (On the other hand, Powerstorm doesn't have any proviso about playing the card.)&nbsp;I agree that if you can repeat it, it should cost no Energy. (Of course, you'rd&nbsp;only save at most 1 Energy that way anyway.)</p>",
